notes.content:
The main novelty of today's update is the addition of a completely new main menu, as well as the redesign of all interface elements in the game. We tried to stick to the “paper” style, reminiscent of the graphics of old comic books of the last century.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44888383/98aec93f6717a7bcb4eb5b7676d758bbd28e159f.png
Also in this update:
- Fixed a bug where porters could ignore one of the two kitchens;
- Fixed a bug where the game could freeze when deleting an exterminator's room;
- Fixed a bug in one of the tutorial steps in Kansas where the game could be softlocked if the laundry room was out of the player's field of sight;
- Fixed display of city icons on the map in different resolutions (previously they could shift sideways);
- Fixed a bug in the tutorial step about building parking lots;
- Fixed some localization issues.

In the coming days we plan to update the interface in the demo version as well.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44888383/ef941d5a2e08ba60309c205ab030e6ee6f5a4840.png
As always, we are waiting for your feedback. Do you like the new interface, has it become more convenient and comfortable to play?

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44888383/b53ba10e856d6011e6f06f61949f463619553c67.png
We are already preparing the next updates. We are planning to rework the logic of exterminators' work and add a new five-star hotel.

Thank you for playing Check Inn!

As always, we invite you to our Discord server to discuss the update - http://discord.gg/invite/9eHyYap and to subscribe to our page on Steam - https://store.steampowered.com/developer/kishmish.
